{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And behold, a lead weight</b> — that is, heavy. The word נשאת is a form from the nif'al binyan, the complete form being ננשאה, like רוח נשברה. The lead was lifted in the ephah." "<b>And this is a woman</b> — a family from Israel."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:01.994744660Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}